            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Over 12 Lakh Indian Chemists Plan May 20 Shutdown Over Fake AI-Generated Prescriptions",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "More than 1.2 million chemists across India are planning a nationwide shop shutdown on May 20 in protest against e-pharmacies allegedly accepting AI-generated fake prescriptions. The strike signals a deepening conflict between traditional pharmacy networks and online medicine platforms over patient safety and regulatory compliance. The dispute exposes a critical gap in India's health regulatory framework as AI tools become capable of producing convincing medical documentation.",
            "url": "https://www.medianama.com/2026/05/223-chemist-strike-against-e-pharmacies-may-20-ai-generated-prescriptions/",
